  "goodToKnow": "Die Arbeitsgruppe is a working group: eine Arbeitsgruppe einrichten (to set one up), the classic German way to deal with a problem. In coalition talks, AGs negotiate each policy area. At school, an AG (Arbeitsgemeinschaft) is an after-school club: die Theater-AG, die Fußball-AG. Careful: AG after a company name means Aktiengesellschaft (plc). Note the linking s: Arbeit-s-gruppe. Plural: die Arbeitsgruppen."
